From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: smit1237 <smit1237@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 22:47:47 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 02/24] linux: RNSBox kernel defconfig

Strip media/framebuffer/sound/Bluetooth/ION/CMA and other unused subsystems;
trim the USB gadget to CDC-NCM plus mass-storage; build cfg80211 in (=y) and
enable RFKILL for the AIC8800 fullmac modpost; default TCP congestion control
to BBR with fq/fq_codel for the router data plane; raise the gadget
mass-storage buffer count. Reticulum does all crypto in userspace via PyCA
cryptography, so the kernel crypto-API ChaCha20/Poly1305/Curve25519 symbols
are left explicitly unset.
---
 .../linux/sg2002_licheervnano_sd_defconfig    | 243 ++++++++++--------
 1 file changed, 137 insertions(+), 106 deletions(-)

diff --git a/build/boards/sg200x/sg2002_licheervnano_sd/linux/sg2002_licheervnano_sd_defconfig b/build/boards/sg200x/sg2002_licheervnano_sd/linux/sg2002_licheervnano_sd_defconfig
