+# === RNSBox: kernel-side crypto symbols left unset ===
+# Reticulum does all crypto in userspace via PyCA cryptography (OpenSSL
+# backend), so the kernel cryptoAPI ChaCha20/Poly1305/Curve25519 entries are
+# not required. Left explicitly unset so Kconfig does not silently re-enable
+# them via select chains from unrelated subsystems.
